		<name>BT Off on Wi-Fi</name>
		<summary>Turns Bluetooth off on your home Wi-Fi and back on when you leave</summary>
		<desc>Switches Bluetooth off while the phone is on one of your chosen Wi-Fi networks,
and (optionally) back on once you have left.

* Several Wi-Fi names; adjustable delay after arriving (default 5 min) and after leaving (default 1 min)
* Stays on while earbuds or headphones are connected; watches never count
* &quot;Keep Bluetooth on&quot; timer from the app, a quick settings tile or the notification
* No internet permission

Android 13+ only lets apps that target Android 12 switch Bluetooth, so this app targets API 31 on purpose.
Location (&quot;Allow all the time&quot;) is needed because Android only reveals the Wi-Fi name to apps with it.</desc>
